   "s": "Nina",
   "t": "Dad, can you show me how to make mashed potatoes?"
  },
  {
   "s": "Dad",
   "t": "Sure. First, wash four big potatoes and cut them up."
  },
  {
   "s": "Nina",
   "t": "Then do I boil them?"
  },
  {
   "s": "Dad",
   "t": "Yes, boil them for about twenty minutes until they are soft."
  },
  {
   "s": "Nina",
   "t": "What should I do next?"
  },
  {
   "s": "Dad",
   "t": "Pour the water out and mash the potatoes. Add a little butter and some milk."
  },
  {
   "s": "Nina",
   "t": "Do I need salt?"
  },
  {
   "s": "Dad",
   "t": "Just a little. Then stir it all together. That's it!"
  }
